---
<style>
  /* From Uiverse.io by kennyotsu-monochromia */
  .custom-bglines {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    --color: #423f3f;
    background-color: #252525;
    background-image: linear-gradient(
        0deg,
        transparent 24.5%,
        var(--color) 24.7%,
        var(--color) 25%,
        transparent 25.2%,
        transparent 74.5%,
        var(--color) 74.7%,
        var(--color) 75%,
        transparent 75.2%,
        transparent
      ),
      linear-gradient(
        90deg,
        transparent 24.5%,
        var(--color) 24.7%,
        var(--color) 25%,
        transparent 25.2%,
        transparent 74.5%,
        var(--color) 74.7%,
        var(--color) 75%,
        transparent 75.2%,
        transparent
      );
    background-size: 180px 180px; /* Increased grid size */
  }
</style>
<section
  class="text-white min-h-screen custom-bglines py-16 px-6 items-center"
>
  <div
    class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-8 md:gap-20 items-center lg:mt-10 lg:pt-10"
  >
    <iframe
      class="w-full h-full rounded-md"
      src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ"
      title="YouTube video player"
      frameborder="0"
      allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
      allowfullscreen
    >
    </iframe>
    <div class="space-y-6 ">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold  custom-underline relative inline-block z-10">
        IMPACT BEYOND WORDS
        <div class="h-1 w-24 bg-orange-500 mt-1"></div>
      </h2>

      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-[2]">
        We don’t just manage brands, we shape how the world <br />
        sees them. Every pixel, every post, every campaign is <br />
        crafted with precision, turning noise into influence. From <br />
        viral social campaigns to compelling brand storytelling, <br />
        <b
          >We Make Sure Your Message Isn’t Just Seen, It’s<br />
          Remembered.</b
        > In a world of distractions, we create <br />
        impact. Simple. Bold. Unforgettable.
      </p>

      <!-- Buttons -->
      <div class="flex gap-4 mt-4">
        <button
          style="background-color:#F56416;"
          class="bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded"
          >Make a Call</button
        >
        <button
          style="background-color:#000000; hover:background-color:#F56416; border-color:#F56416;color:#F56416"
          class="border px-4 py-2 rounded">Our Services</button
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .custom-underline::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  bottom: 0.3em; /* Adjust spacing from text */
  width: 100%;
  height: 8px; /* Thickness of underline */
  background-color: #F56416; /* Orange color */
  z-index: -1; /* Behind the text */
  border-radius: 2px; /* Optional: rounded ends */
}

</style>